# Claude Code's own files.
#
# `.claude/NG.md` is appended to by `/readable:ng`, which writes one table row
# per word and does not pad the columns. `bun run prettier --check .` covers
# the whole repository, so every recorded word would fail CI until someone ran
# prettier over the file by hand - and the next recorded word would break it
# again. The handoff notes that live beside it are written the same way.
#
# Nothing under here is served, built or imported. It is read by people and by
# Claude Code, neither of which cares whether the columns line up.
.claude/
